<div class="doc-section">
    <h2>Parameters</h2>
    <div class="doc-table-wrap">
        <table class="doc-table doc-api-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>ChildContent</td><td>RenderFragment?</td><td>—</td><td>The buttons: <code>NxButton</code>s and <code>NxDropDownButton</code>s.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Variant</td><td>NxButtonVariant?</td><td>—</td><td>Applies to every NxButton that does not set its own.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Size</td><td>NxSize?</td><td>—</td><td>Applies to every NxButton that does not set its own.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Disabled</td><td>bool</td><td>false</td><td>Disables every button.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>FullWidth</td><td>bool</td><td>false</td><td>The group fills its container; the buttons share the width.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>AriaLabel</td><td>string?</td><td>—</td><td>The group's name (<code>role="group"</code>).</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Class / Style</td><td>string?</td><td>—</td><td>On the group; other attributes go there too.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="doc-section">
    <h2>CSS Variables</h2>
    <p class="doc-note">The buttons' own (<code>--nx-radius</code> rounds the group's outer corners). Shared borders overlap by 1 px; a hovered or focused button comes forward.</p>
</div>

